# Power BI Dashboard - Bank BNI Performance Analysis

## Overview
This dashboard analyzes the performance and transaction data
of Bank BNI branches across multiple regions.

## Key Metrics
- Achievement Rate: 51.33%
- Total Transactions: Rp50,105...
- Total Findings: 25K

## Visualizations
- Branch performance achievement (Bar Chart)
- Total transactions by product type (Tabungan, Deposito, Kredit)
- Total findings by branch (Horizontal Bar Chart)

## Tools
- Microsoft Power BI
